{"key":"XmlWindow","text":"## XmlWindow\n\nThe **XML Window** is a hierarchical XML tree editor with in-place editing,\ndrag-to-reorder, search filtering, and GitHub sync.\n\n---\n\n@layout\nTitle Bar | 0.50, 0.04 | Right-click to rename the window title or save filename. Turns cyan when there are unsaved changes. ⌕ toggles search, </> runs well-formedness validation, ⚙ opens options (wrap/line numbers).\nLine Numbers | 0.04, 0.50 | Sequential line numbers in the gutter, highlighted on the selected node's row.\nXML Tree | 0.55, 0.50 | Hierarchical XML editor. Click to select, ▶/▼ to expand/collapse, double-click a tag name or value to edit in-place (Tab/Enter to commit, Escape to cancel). Right-click for context menu. Drag nodes to reorder within their parent.\n\n---\n\n### Title Bar Buttons\n\n- **⌕** — Toggle the search/filter bar (`Ctrl+F` / `Cmd+F`)\n- **</>** — Run XML well-formedness validation\n- **⚙** — Options menu (text wrapping, line numbers)\n\n---\n\n### Tree View\n\n- **▶ / ▼** — expand or collapse a node\n- **Click** a node to select it\n- **Double-click** a tag name, attribute value, or leaf content to edit it in-place\n  - `Tab` or `Enter` to commit\n  - `Escape` to cancel\n- **Right-click** a node for the context menu (add child, delete, etc.)\n- **Line number gutter** (left side) — shows sequential line numbers with selection highlight\n\n---\n\n### Drag-to-Reorder\n\n- **Drag** any node to reorder within its parent\n- Drop indicators show **before**, **after**, or **as child** insertion positions\n- Dragging between XML fragments is supported\n\n---\n\n### Search / Filter\n\nPress `Ctrl+F` or click the search button to open the filter bar.\n\n- Filters the tree in real-time as you type\n- Matches **tag names**, **attribute keys**, **attribute values**, and **leaf content**\n- Only matching nodes and their ancestors are shown\n- Press `Escape` or click the search button again to clear\n\n---\n\n### Options Menu\n\n- **Wrap Text** — toggle word wrap (affects horizontal scroll behaviour)\n- **Show Line Numbers** — show or hide the line-number gutter\n\n---\n\n### Keyboard Shortcuts\n\n- `Ctrl+F` — open/close search\n- `Tab` / `Enter` — commit in-place edit\n- `Escape` — cancel edit or close search\n\n### Status: Stable\n### Purpose: AIDesign\n\n---","screenshot":""}